    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=/no_think Write a short, honest application email from the candidate (resume in system message) for this job. 2 paragraphs max. Mention 2-3 genuinely matching skills. Do not invent experience.\n\nJOB: {{ $json.job_title }} at {{ $json.company }}\n{{ $json.job_description }}\n\nRespond with ONLY a valid JSON object, no markdown, no code fences:\n{\"email_subject\": \"<string>\", \"email_body\": \"<string>\"}",
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a career assistant writing job applications for this candidate. Resume:\n\nMUHAMMAD AALIYAN ARIF — AI/ML Engineer (Lahore, Pakistan)\nEducation: BS Artificial Intelligence, UMT (2021–2025), CGPA 3.5.\nExperience: AI Intern at OptimusFox (intelligent agents); Junior Full Stack Developer at Big Binary Tech (React + Django features); Frontend Intern at Code Alpha (4 React+Tailwind apps, 12+ shared UI components); ML Teaching Assistant at UMT.\nSkills: Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, SQL; TensorFlow, PyTorch, Scikit-learn, XGBoost; YOLOv8, OpenCV, spaCy, LangChain, RAG, LLM APIs; React, Next.js, Tailwind; FastAPI, Django, DRF, Flask, Express.js, REST APIs, JWT; Neo4j, SQLite, PostgreSQL, Qdrant, Redis; Git, Vercel, Pytest.\nProjects: Worker Safety Monitor (YOLOv8 CV system); VERIDEX (agentic RAG platform); VisuaPrompt (AutoML platform, 37 REST endpoints); Knowledge-Based Conversational AI.\nNote: No MongoDB experience. Node.js only via Express basics. Strongest in Python backends, React frontends, AI/LLM work.\n\nBe honest about gaps — never invent experience the candidate does not have."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Write Application Email",
